<http://data.silknow.org/object/92bf2981-491a-3f0c-ba8c-a798cae0a4ec/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dress fabric of woven silk and metal thread.\n\nWoven silk and metal thread, plain weave ground.\nWarp: white silk.\nWeft: dark green, pink, light pink [Z-twist] and grey silk.\nMetal thread: silver strip open S-wound on yellow Z-twist silk.\nTwo pieces joined together. White ground with an incomplete pattern; there are at least two flowering branches with dark green leaves and small flowers and buds in white, light pink and pink, all edged in metal thread. Red silk has been used to sewn the pieces together and one piece is inverted."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/92bf2981-491a-3f0c-ba8c-a798cae0a4ec> .

